# Adelaide Smart City — Real-Time Vehicle Analytics


An end-to-end Microsoft Fabric analytics project that ingests Adelaide Metro vehicle-position data, transforms it in a Fabric Lakehouse, and presents live operational insights through an interactive Power BI dashboard.

The solution is designed to automatically ingest new vehicle-position data every 5 minutes and provide an up-to-date view of vehicle activity across the Adelaide metropolitan network.

---

## 🚍 Project Overview

This project demonstrates a complete modern data analytics workflow:

**Data ingestion → Data storage → Transformation → Aggregation → Semantic model → Power BI visualization**

The dashboard provides an operational view of:

- Total vehicles currently represented in the dataset
- Average vehicle speed
- Maximum recorded speed
- Number of active routes
- Live vehicle locations across Adelaide
- Vehicle count by route
- Average speed by route

